# Claude Code local config
.claude/

# Exception: fixture data for test_mutation_analysis.py's malformed-config fail-closed
# case. analyze_mutations.py hardcodes .claude/mutation-patterns.yaml as its config path,
# so the fixture must live at exactly that relative location to exercise the real code
# path — both the directory and its contents need unignoring for git to descend into it.
!tests/rhize-devflow/fixtures/mutation/malformed_config_project/.claude/
!tests/rhize-devflow/fixtures/mutation/malformed_config_project/.claude/**

